broadcast
# Local chain artifacts.
#
# `deployments/31337/*` is rewritten from scratch by every `pnpm dev:local` and
# describes an anvil instance that stops existing when the process does. Tracked
# copies do not merely go unused — they go WRONG, and quietly: the committed
# SlotsTestToken record named an address with no code for as long as the seed
# had been deploying it somewhere else, and the app kept offering that token
# while every approval reverted.
#
# Scoped to 31337 on purpose. Real chains' records are the deployment ledger and
# stay tracked; `contracts-upgrade.yml` commits them.
deployments/31337/*.json
